# M17 armour over the network, flow "m17_two_clients" side B: a Kargan rogue buys the Yeminli leather vest and leggings
# at Demirci Ilgaz, puts them on, walks to the Aydor of side A (m17_two_a.voscript, sitting = done) and checks A's
# heavy chest and legs as ENTITY_SPAWN / ENTITY_EQUIP delivered them; screenshots of A in its armour from here.
wait 5
waitfor login+idle 120
clickon login.username
text m17_two_b
clickon login.password
text gizli123
key enter
waitfor charcreate+race+idle 900
clickon create.race.kargan
clickon create.next
waitfor charcreate+details 60
clickon create.class.2
clickon create.name
text Derici
clickon create.submit
waitfor charselect+idle+chars1 900
clickon select.enter
waitfor world+ready+idle+invloaded+coinsknown+npcs2 1800
scene talk Demirci Ilgaz
waitfor world+shopopen+inv 900
scene shopbuy 121
waitfor world+modal 120
clickon messagebox.button0
waitfor world+bought1+shopidle 600
scene shopbuy 122
waitfor world+modal 120
clickon messagebox.button0
waitfor world+bought2+shopidle 600
key escape
wait 10
scene armorlog
scene expectbag 0 121
scene expectbag 1 122
scene itemmove bag0 chest
waitfor world+itemsidle 300
scene itemmove bag1 legs
waitfor world+itemsidle 300
scene inventory close
wait 30
scene expectlocalarmor 2
waitfor world+remotes1 3600
scene markremote Zirhli
waitfor world+remotesitting 3600
scene walktoremote Zirhli 3
waitfor world+nodest+standing 2400
waitfor world+remotenear8 600
wait 30
scene expectremotearmor Zirhli 0 116 117 0 0
scene camera at:Zirhli 12 4.2
wait 15
screenshot two_b_sees_a.png
scene camera at:Zirhli@180 15 5
wait 15
screenshot two_b_both.png
wait 600
quit
